      "passage_id": "passage_fa7e3f4db648bafcec53e87c",
      "supporting_excerpt": "The applicable subheading for the Liquid-Cooled High-Power EV Charging Cable Assembly, part number S8600-YR05X-A0-USG will be 8544.42.9090... In your request, you state that the manufacturing process for the cable occurs in Korea... eligibility under the United States-Korea Free Trade Agreement (UKFTA)",
      "relevance_explanation": "This passage identifies a specific company (Yura Co. Ltd.) and product classification but does not state the final duty rate or confirm the exemption status, only that a ruling was requested.",
      "company_applicability": "explicit_named_company_effect",
      "temporal_status": "source_reports_historical"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_0a0125fb4c8983c741bb701b",
      "supporting_excerpt": "The rate and effective date for tariffs on copper are yet to be determined by the Department of Commerce's investigation. The active 25% tariff on all steel and aluminum imports could raise costs for charger enclosures/housing, mounting systems, and conduit and cable trays.",
