      "supporting_excerpt": "The introduction of US tariffs in 2025 is poised to reshape the electric vehicle (EV) charging market... Tariffs on copper and steel may raise costs for EV charger cables and enclosures. ... Switchgear and transformer costs could increase due to tariffs on steel and aluminum.",
